IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTITENANT-SCHED.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TENANTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-CAPACITY      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FAIR-SHARE-BUDGET   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MULTITENANT.
    IF NUM-TENANTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE FAIR-SHARE-BUDGET = TOTAL-CAPACITY / NUM-TENANTS.
    IF FAIR-SHARE-BUDGET == 0
        MOVE 256 TO FAIR-SHARE-BUDGET.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FAIR-SHARE-BUDGET.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-TENANTS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
